  "title": "Peanut Butter Cookies",
  "description": "A very delicious peanut butter cookie recipe that is easy to make. These cookies stay soft in an airtight container. For special occasions, press five peanut halves into the top before baking.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda White"
  ],
